{"id": "t055-002", "text": "Called Jorge. He and Camila have a second flat viewing in Leith on Saturday morning, and they're putting in an offer the next day if it's as good as the photos.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second flat viewing in Leith", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t055-005", "text": "Lunch with Nadia. Her brother Karan has just moved to Toronto for a job at a bank, and their parents are visiting him over Christmas. She is pretending she's fine about it but she misses him a lot.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved to Toronto", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "job at a bank", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting him", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "misses him a lot", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t055-006", "text": "Saanvi hates long flights. She's off to Sydney in early March and already dreading the twenty-two hours. Don't forget to send her that list of podcasts before she goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates long flights", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Sydney", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the twenty-two hours", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that list of podcasts", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she goes", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t055-012", "text": "Need to book my own flights to Lisbon before the prices go up. Sometime this week ideally.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book my own flights to Lisbon", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flights to Lisbon", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the prices go up", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sometime this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t055-015", "text": "Marcus and Shanice are expecting! Due early April. They told us at dinner and then spent the rest of the evening arguing about names.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early April", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the rest of the evening"}]}
{"id": "t055-017", "text": "Mihai's sister Elena is coming over from Bucharest for two weeks at the end of the month. It is her first time in the UK, and he has planned far too much. He wants to take her to the Lake District the weekend after she arrives, then London for a couple of days, then a night in York before she flies home. She loves hiking, so the Lakes will be the highlight. Remind me to ask Mihai if they want to borrow the tent.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elena", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Bucharest", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "take her to the Lake District", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after she arrives", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "London", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of days", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "night in York", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she flies home", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "hiking", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Mihai if they want to borrow the tent", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t055-022", "text": "Theo has a second interview with a firm in Edinburgh on the 14th. If it goes well he and Jaya will relocate in the spring. He seemed calm, Jaya less so.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second interview with a firm in Edinburgh", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "relocate", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "calm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t055-024", "text": "Groceries, post office, and renew my passport before the trip. Probably Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Groceries", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post office", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "renew my passport", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a3"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t055-027", "text": "Hemi's grandad turns ninety next Sunday. The whole family is flying to Auckland for it, and Hemi is giving a speech at the party that evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns ninety", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Auckland", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t055-030", "text": "Jorge's sister had her baby on Tuesday, a little girl called Rosa. He's flying out to Mexico City to meet her sometime next month. I should get a small gift for him to take.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "owner": "r1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out to Mexico City", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a small gift for him to take", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t055-033", "text": "Femi is struggling a bit since moving to Glasgow. Doesn't know anyone yet and the job is full on. Must call him this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling a bit", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Glasgow", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "job is full on", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t055-034", "text": "Nadia is off to Marrakech with her mum and her aunt at the end of the month. Her aunt has never been on a plane before, so Nadia is a bit worried about the flight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Marrakech", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit worried", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t055-035", "text": "Saanvi's housewarming has been cancelled. The movers lost half her boxes and she's still sleeping on a mattress on the floor.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost half her boxes", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t055-036", "text": "Bruno said Henrik has been offered the Singapore job. It's a big promotion, head of the regional team, and he would start in early January. He has to decide by Friday, and his partner Marcus is not keen on moving that far, mostly because his parents are getting older and he doesn't want to be a thirteen-hour flight away. Bruno thinks Henrik will take it anyway. Don't forget to ask Henrik on Monday what he decided.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered the Singapore job", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "head of the regional team", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "decide", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not keen on moving that far", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "getting older", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Henrik on Monday what he decided", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t055-038", "text": "Hiroshi's parents land at Heathrow on the 3rd. He's picking them up that morning and they're staying with him until mid-December. Remind me to ask Hiroshi how the first week went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hiroshi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "land at Heathrow", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until mid-December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Hiroshi how the first week went", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hiroshi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t055-044", "text": "Khadija and her sister Esther are viewing a house together in Sheffield this weekend. It is a three-bed terrace near the park, and if they like it they want to put in an offer the next day before anyone else does. Their mum is lending them the deposit, which she keeps reminding them about. Khadija sounded excited; Esther is much more cautious and worried about what happens if one of them wants to move out later. Remind me to text Khadija on Sunday to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing a house together in Sheffield", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before anyone else does", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "cautious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Khadija", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t055-047", "text": "Shanice mentioned she has been eyeing a good suitcase for ages. Her old one fell apart in Rome. Could be a nice leaving present before she moves to Dublin.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eyeing a good suitcase", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moves to Dublin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t055-048", "text": "Spoke to Esther Kaur after the meeting. She moved to Birmingham in the summer and loves it. Her husband is still commuting to London twice a week, which is wearing him down.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther Kaur", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the meeting"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved to Birmingham", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "commuting to London twice a week", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wearing him down", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t055-050", "text": "Theo's moving to Bristol at the end of the month and his leaving drinks are on the Friday before. Must remember to sign his card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sign his card", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t055-053", "text": "Jaya's sister Lila is getting married in Goa early next year. Jaya is maid of honour and has to organise the hen do sometime in the autumn, for fourteen women across three countries who all want different things. On top of that she is flying out a week before the wedding to help their mum with the mehndi, and her boss has only just approved the leave. She is quietly losing her mind but says it is fine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Goa", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "maid of honour", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the autumn", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week before the wedding", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "quietly losing her mind", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t055-056", "text": "Lwazi went to the viewing on Tuesday and loved it. He put in an offer that evening and heard back the next morning. Accepted! Send him a congratulations message.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next morning"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send him a congratulations message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t055-057", "text": "Dinner with Jorge Lopez, Noor and Liam. Jorge is moving to Madrid in early spring for work, and he has somehow sorted out his whole life over one plate of pasta. Noor is buying his car, Liam is taking over the lease on his flat, and his plants are coming to me. He flies out the week after his leaving party, and his girlfriend Camila follows at the end of March once her notice period is done. Very efficient friendship group.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge Lopez", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Madrid", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies out", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p7"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "follows", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p7"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of March", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "once her notice period is done", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t055-058", "text": "I'm flying to Montreal on the 9th for Femi's wedding. Staying a week after with Nadia and her family. Need to buy a suit before then.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Montreal", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a suit", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t055-059", "text": "Saanvi's grandparents celebrated their fiftieth anniversary at the weekend. She flew to Mumbai for it and came back the next day, completely exhausted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandparents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fiftieth anniversary", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flew to Mumbai", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t055-060", "text": "Henrik's mum, Mrs Nakamura, is visiting from Osaka over the holidays. It is her first trip abroad since his dad died, so he wants it to be special. He is taking her to Edinburgh for a few days after Christmas, and then they will see the New Year in with his partner's family in Manchester. She doesn't eat pork, which he is worried about for the dinner. Remind me to send Henrik the hotel recommendation.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Nakamura", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Osaka", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the holidays", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking her to Edinburgh", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "see the New Year in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat pork", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Henrik the hotel recommendation", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}]}
